# Draft PRs = no checks

Save CI/Vercel until the PR is ready for review.

## Rule

| PR state | GitHub Actions | Vercel preview |
|----------|----------------|----------------|
| **draft** | Jobs skipped (`ci.yml` `if`) | Ignored via `scripts/vercel-ignore-draft-pr.sh` |
| **ready** | Runs normally | Preview builds |
| **push** to `development` / `main` | Always runs (not a PR event) | `main` auto-deploy off; `development` builds |

## Agent behavior

- Open WIP as **draft** when checks/previews not needed yet.
- Mark **Ready for review** when you want lint/typecheck + preview (triggers `ready_for_review`).
- Do **not** add branch-only `deploymentEnabled` hacks for draft pause — use this global rule.
- After merge of draft-skip tooling: rebase open draft feature PRs onto `development` so they pick up `ci.yml` / `vercel.json`.

## Vercel token

Preview env needs `GITHUB_TOKEN` (or `GH_TOKEN`) with `repo` / `pull_requests: read` so the ignore script can see draft status on this private repo. Without it, script **fails closed** (cancels feature-branch builds).

